
// self_emit.tk -- stage 4 of self-hosting: sexp -> x86-64 assembly.
// Input: canonical sexp (self_parse.tk --sexp output). Output: .s text.
// Must be BYTE-IDENTICAL to C x64_emit on the corpus (see `emitdiff`).
// Assembly: cat emit0.tk tkast_gen.tk emit1.tk ... > self_emit.tk

